  "description": "CR 712.11a, 715.3a, 715.2b, 707.2, 111.1, 715.2c, 603.7c, 608.2d: Terra, Magical Adept's Trance returns it as Esper Terra, a Saga back face entering with a lore counter; chapter I copies a nonlegendary enchantment its controller controls, the copy gains haste and, being a Saga, takes up to three more lore counters, and is sacrificed at its controller's next end step",
